TITLE Kinetic dissolution of Calcite in hydrothermal solution at 100C
# Using built-in Calcite rate law with PARM(1)=specific surface area, PARM(2)=M/M0 exponent

SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        5
    pe        4
    units     mmol/kgw
    C(4)      0.5
    Mn        1.0

KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -m0    1.0
    -m     1.0
    -parms 10.0  0.001
    -step  1000 in 100
    -tol   1e-8

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   calcite_kinetic6.sel
    -reset  false
    -step   true
    -time   true
    -pH     true
    -pe     true
    -si     Calcite
    -totals Ca C(4) Mn

USER_PUNCH
-headings pH_precise
-start
10 PUNCH -LA("H+")
-end

END
